        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="support_n370" value="Cross-page aliases repeat the existing User, ReferenceValue,&#10;and operational entities. They do not create additional tables.&#10;A nullable FK has partial participation; required FKs have total&#10;participation. Every parent may have no dependent records." style="shape=text;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A9BAC6;strokeWidth=1.6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#526575;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2410" width="1120" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="support_n371" value="Reference administration&#10;Validate Domain + IsActive in controlled writes; an FK alone&#10;does not prevent choosing a value from the wrong category.&#10;Preserve referenced IDs, codes and domains. Inactive values&#10;remain visible in history. Do not deactivate codes needed by&#10;open work or enabled workflow transitions." style="shape=text;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A9BAC6;strokeWidth=1.6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#526575;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2550" width="1120" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="support_n372" value="PK = primary key (underlined)   FK = foreign key   UK = unique key   NULL = nullable; other attributes required.&#10;Endpoint 1 / N / M = maximum cardinality. T = total participation (double line); P = partial participation (single line).&#10;1:N and N:1 are opposite readings of one relationship. Optionality is separate from maximum cardinality." style="shape=text;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A9BAC6;strokeWidth=1.6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#526575;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2820" width="2380" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="support_n373" value="Proposed MySQL types: INT / BIGINT / SMALLINT are UNSIGNED; TS = DATETIME(6); MONEY = DECIMAL(12,2);&#10;Vn = VARCHAR(n); BOOL = TINYINT(1). Composite FKs use all listed columns together. Dates use the warehouse time zone." style="shape=text;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A9BAC6;strokeWidth=1.6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#526575;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2903" width="2380" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>